    "    \"placing\": { \"overall\": 40, \"field\": 114 },",
    "    \"note\": \"Anything worth remembering\",",
    "    \"links\": [{ \"kind\": \"results\", \"url\": \"…\" }]",
    "  }",
    "",
    "\"race\" only matters when Strava disagrees. Strava flags races through",
    "workout_type, but only for runs and rides — a skimo race cannot be flagged",
    "at all, which is why the ski races below say \"race\": true. Set it to false",
    "to drop something Strava flagged that was not really a race.",
    "",
    "Several entries below have no location yet — they were found on Strava",
    "rather than typed out by hand, and guessing where they were is not this",
    "file's job. Fill them in as you go."
